    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const events = $input.all()\n  .filter(item => item.json.id);\n\nconst appointments = events.map(item => {\n  const event = item.json;\n  const description = event.description || '';\n\n  return {\n    event_id: event.id,\n    email: description.match(/^Email:\\s*(.*)$/m)?.[1] || '',\n    full_name: description.match(/^Customer:\\s*(.*)$/m)?.[1] || '',\n    appointment_type: description.match(/^Appointment Type:\\s*(.*)$/m)?.[1] || '',\n    start_time: event.start?.dateTime || event.start?.date || null,\n    end_time: event.end?.dateTime || event.end?.date || null\n  };\n});\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    success: true,\n    message: appointments.length\n      ? 'Appointments retrieved successfully.'\n      : 'No upcoming appointments found.',\n    total: appointments.length,\n    appointments\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -96
      ],
      "id": "b389d8e9-830b-4333-b401-a03c3a14435c",
      "name": "Return User Appointments"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PRJ001 - Tool - Find User Appointments\n\n**Purpose:** Retrieves a customer's upcoming appointments using their authenticated email.\n\n**Inputs:** `session_id`, `max_days`\n\n**Process:**\n1. Retrieve and validate the customer's Redis session.\n2. Search Google Calendar for upcoming events matching the authenticated email.\n3. Extract appointment details and return the results.\n\n**Output:** Total appointments and an array containing `event_id`, `email`, `full_name`, `appointment_type`, `start_time`, and `end_time`.\n\n**Error Handling:** Handles unauthenticated sessions and Google Calendar errors.\n\n**Important:** Past appointments are excluded. Event IDs are included for future cancellation and rescheduling.\n\n**Dependencies:** Redis and Google Calendar.",
        "height": 336,
        "width": 976,
        "color": 4
      },
